Chip tried to grab Hayley\'92s tablet; she deftly evaded his clutch. Chip straightened. \'93Fridge Force does not comment on in-kitchen matters,\'94 he recited from the FF public relations playbook.\
\'93Of course. Look, I\'92m not interested in the Chuglinghams,\'94 she said, which was false. The next bit would be tricky. \'93I have information\'85 about national security\'85\'94\
